// # WASM AUDIT INDEX — 19 wasm_*.oot files mapped to three waves
//
// Logline: Nineteen wasm_*.oot files map to the 12-role master, the COORD if-fold wave, and the Loop-12 advanced-folds wave whose assignment is pending.
//
// Setup: Read wasm_phalanx.oot, all 19 wasm_*.oot files, and the post-phalanx sibling pick files wasm_emit.oo, wasm_emit_pick_print.oo, wasm_emit_pick_if.oo. Each evidence pair is on disk.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Name the three waves and the post-phalanx sibling code on disk.
//   2. List every wasm_*.oot file with line count, wave, role, status, and on-disk evidence.
//   3. Summarize totals and note the Loop-12 wave-assignment gap.

## 1. Wave taxonomy

  Three waves are on disk.

  12-role master (wasm_phalanx.oot:39-71) names twelve roles:
    DE1, DE2, RT, PV1, PV2, SEC, MEM, INT, HARN, HYG, DOCS,
    COORD. The master lists owner file paths and forbids any
    second role on the same write path (wasm_phalanx.oot:62).
    Frozen API and ship bar live at wasm_phalanx.oot:9-30.

  COORD-wave (if-fixture review):
    wasm_coord.oot:1 "Wave: parent rebuild and if-fixture
    review". wasm_coord.oot:8 re-uses existing roles for
    if-fold review after a parent rebuild. wasm_harn2.oot
    is new for the if-false fixture; wasm_harn.oot was
    extended for the if-true fixture (wasm_coord.oot:48-49,
    wasm_coord.oot:71-90).

  Loop-12 (advanced const-print folds):
    wasm_arch.oot:1 "Loop 12 five named const-print folds",
    wasm_pipe.oot:1 "Loop 12 five detectors", plus
    wasm_qa.oot, wasm_sk1.oot, wasm_sk2.oot. The five
    sibling detector .oo files are listed in
    wasm_emit_pick_print.oo:32 and wasm_emit_pick_if.oo:62-65.
    Wave assignment is pending.

  Post-phalanx sibling code on disk:
    ooda/oodac/wasm_emit.oo (66 lines) is the entry point
    and imports wasm_emit_fold.oo:15, wasm_emit_pick_print.oo:16,
    wasm_emit_pick_if.oo:17. ooda/oodac/wasm_emit_pick_print.oo
    (73 lines) tries 28 const-print and arith detectors.
    ooda/oodac/wasm_emit_pick_if.oo (121 lines) tries 52
    const-if detectors. Both end with `return lit;`.

