## 3. Status evidence

  Every [x] row is backed by an explicit verdict or status
  line in that file. The 12-role master [x] rows rest on:

    wasm_phalanx.oot is the master itself; its role list at
      wasm_phalanx.oot:39-71 is the source of truth.
    wasm_de1.oot:130 "hello fold is still let IDENT =
      greet(STRING); println(IDENT); only. Extra println
      misses. Fold already exact."
    wasm_de2.oot:182 "two-println unchanged yes. int-lit
      unchanged yes. Two STRING prints still join with
      newline. INT lit still returns digits only. Mixed
      second print misses. Folded 1+2 misses."
    wasm_harn.oot:57 "Review complete. Fixture body matches.
      Smoke drives product oodac."
    wasm_hyg.oot:86 "Lines: PASS Headers on emit .oo: PASS
      Files over 256: none".
    wasm_int.oot:18 "PASS" plus wasm_int.oot:152 "PASS.
      Product emit-wasm ship bar holds on existing locks
      after rebuild."
    wasm_mem.oot:16 "PASS. emit_n does not clear ovf.
      Oversized print is ERR wasm buf. No dummy `\0asm`."
      plus wasm_mem.oot:194 "Status: MEM buf audit is PASS."
    wasm_pv1.oot:18 "PASS" plus wasm_pv1.oot:160 "PASS.
      Condition is IDENT x. Smoke fails only on fold-me-only
      stdout or bytes."
    wasm_pv2.oot:18 "If-fold is named. Boards do not stop at
      print-lit through int-lit." plus wasm_pv2.oot:137
      "Status: if-fold is named. Dummy `end`, browser host
      residual, not-complete-backend, and C+gcc everyday
      still hold. No board edit."
    wasm_rt.oot:22 "no runtime change required" plus
      wasm_rt.oot:187 "Status: done for the RT seal."
    wasm_sec.oot:18 "ovf-not-cleared: yes check-before-emit:
      yes" plus wasm_sec.oot:76 "Status: PASS. Both proofs
      hold on disk."
    wasm_docs.oot:16 "Already named. Not PROPOSED. Not APPLIED
      this turn." plus wasm_docs.oot:79 "Status: if-fold
      already named. Residuals quoted. Boards not edited."
    wasm_coord.oot:226 "Status: COORD wave written. Emit is
      not implemented in this file."
    wasm_harn2.oot:53 "Status: Review complete. Fixture body
      matches. Smoke drives product oodac."

